{"seq": 33, "type": "text", "ts": "2026-11-23T10:00:33+00:00", "text": "Gold customers bring the most revenue in both channels: 410.50 online and 300 in store, ahead of Silver (280.25 and 190) and Bronze (120.00 and 95). Monthly revenue rose from 1520.5 in January to 2205.75 in April, with a dip to 1390.0 in March; orders followed the same pattern, from 12 to 18. Larger baskets spend more: an order of 8 items averaged 121.0."}
